      "subtopic": "Git 忽略规则",
      "knowledgePoint": "无斜杠模式",
      "questionType": "概念与原理",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "在仓库根目录的 .gitignore 中，*.log 通常能匹配子目录内未跟踪的日志文件吗？",
      "answer": "能；没有目录分隔符的模式可以匹配该 .gitignore 所在目录及其下层中的名称。",
      "explanation": "规则作用于该文件所在目录及其后代。",
      "example": "nested/train.log 可以被匹配。",
      "tags": [
        "Git",
        "无斜杠模式"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://github.com/git/git/blob/v2.53.0/Documentation/gitignore.adoc"
    },
    {
      "id": "gitignore-002",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "进阶",
      "subtopic": "Git 忽略规则",
      "knowledgePoint": "根目录锚定",
      "questionType": "概念与原理",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "根目录 .gitignore 中的 /build/ 与 build/ 在匹配位置上有什么区别？",
      "answer": "/build/ 只匹配该 .gitignore 所在目录下的 build 目录；build/ 还可匹配下层同名目录。",
      "explanation": "前导斜杠使匹配位置相对于当前 .gitignore 固定。",
      "example": "/build/ 不匹配 nested/build/。",
      "tags": [
        "Git",
        "根目录锚定"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://github.com/git/git/blob/v2.53.0/Documentation/gitignore.adoc"
    },
    {
      "id": "gitignore-003",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "进阶",
      "subtopic": "Git 忽略规则",
      "knowledgePoint": "目录模式",
      "questionType": "概念与原理",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "Git 忽略模式末尾的 / 限定匹配什么？",
      "answer": "它限定该模式匹配目录；匹配的目录内容也会被排除。",
      "explanation": "不带末尾斜杠的模式也可能匹配普通文件。",
      "example": "cache/ 匹配目录 cache。",
      "tags": [
        "Git",
        "目录模式"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://github.com/git/git/blob/v2.53.0/Documentation/gitignore.adoc"
    },
    {
      "id": "gitignore-004",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "进阶",
      "subtopic": "Git 忽略规则",
      "knowledgePoint": "通配符跨目录",
      "questionType": "概念与原理",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "Git 忽略模式 logs/*.log 中的 * 能跨越路径分隔符匹配 logs/a/x.log 吗？",
      "answer": "不能；单个 * 不匹配斜杠，logs/*.log 匹配 logs 下直接一层的名称。",
      "explanation": "匹配范围以该 .gitignore 所在目录为基准。",
      "example": "logs/a.log 可匹配，logs/a/b.log 不匹配。",
      "tags": [
        "Git",
        "通配符跨目录"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://github.com/git/git/blob/v2.53.0/Documentation/gitignore.adoc"
    },
    {
      "id": "gitignore-005",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "进阶",
      "subtopic": "Git 忽略规则",
      "knowledgePoint": "递归通配",
      "questionType": "概念与原理",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "Git 忽略模式 logs/**/debug.txt 中的 **/ 有什么作用？",
      "answer": "它可匹配零层或多层目录，例如 logs/debug.txt 与 logs/a/b/debug.txt。",
      "explanation": "特殊的 **/ 可以包含零个或多个中间目录。",
      "example": "logs/a/debug.txt 也可匹配。",
      "tags": [
        "Git",
        "递归通配"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://github.com/git/git/blob/v2.53.0/Documentation/gitignore.adoc"
    },
    {
      "id": "gitignore-006",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "进阶",
      "subtopic": "Git 忽略规则",
      "knowledgePoint": "否定与父目录",
      "questionType": "概念与原理",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "根目录 .gitignore 先忽略 cache/，再写 !cache/keep.txt，能重新包含该文件吗？",
      "answer": "不能；父目录已被排除时，Git 通常不会遍历其内容，需要先让父目录可被遍历。",
      "explanation": "Git 通常不会继续枚举已排除目录的内容。",
      "example": "先允许 cache/，再排除目录内其他项目。",
      "tags": [
        "Git",
        "否定与父目录"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://github.com/git/git/blob/v2.53.0/Documentation/gitignore.adoc"
    },
    {
      "id": "gitignore-007",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "进阶",
      "subtopic": "Git 忽略规则",
      "knowledgePoint": "规则顺序",
      "questionType": "概念与原理",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "同一层级的 Git 忽略规则有多个匹配时，通常由哪条决定结果？",
      "answer": "同一优先级内最后一个匹配的模式决定结果，包括否定模式。",
      "explanation": "不同来源和目录层级的规则还存在优先级。",
      "example": "先写 *.log，后写 !keep.log 可放行后者。",
      "tags": [
        "Git",
        "规则顺序"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://github.com/git/git/blob/v2.53.0/Documentation/gitignore.adoc"
    },
    {
      "id": "gitignore-008",
